usage: analyze_lean_arithmetic_telemetry.py [-h] --telemetry TELEMETRY
                                            --capture CAPTURE --out OUT

Recompute observed arithmetic wall intervals and integer LP shapes. Reads a
finished capture and its original JSONL. Does not launch Lean, choose inputs,
weaken feedback comparison, estimate CPU time, or extrapolate GPU gains.
Nested scopes are merged by session/request before aggregation; absent
durations remain absent. Oracle and native-client LP rows are separate
observation layers.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --telemetry TELEMETRY
  --capture CAPTURE
  --out OUT
